# Traduction IA – à relire
#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh darling lover! You return to me!"
msgstr "Oh, mon amour chéri ! Tu me reviens !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/8/s/0
